{
  "matthew.27.p1.b1": {
    "text": "到了早晨，众祭司长和民间的长老大家商议要治死耶稣，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "到⁠了早⁠晨，众祭⁠司⁠长和民⁠间的长⁠老大⁠家商⁠议要治死耶⁠稣，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p1.b2": {
    "text": "就把他捆绑，解去，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就⁠把他捆⁠绑，解去，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p1.b3": {
    "text": "交给巡抚彼拉多。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "交⁠给巡⁠抚彼⁠拉⁠多。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p2.b1": {
    "text": "这时候，卖耶稣的犹大看见耶稣已经定了罪，就后悔，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这时⁠候，卖耶⁠稣的犹⁠大看⁠见耶⁠稣已⁠经定了罪，就后⁠悔，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p2.b2": {
    "text": "把那三十块钱拿回来给祭司长和长老，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "把那三十⁠块⁠钱拿⁠回⁠来给祭⁠司⁠长和长⁠老，说："
  },
  "matthew.27.p2.b3": {
    "text": "我卖了无辜之人的血是有罪了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我卖了无⁠辜之人⁠的血是有⁠罪了。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p2.b4": {
    "text": "那与我们有什么相干？你自己承当吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那与我⁠们有什⁠么相⁠干？你自⁠己承当吧！"
  },
  "matthew.27.p3.b1": {
    "text": "犹大就把那银钱丢在殿里，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "犹⁠大就⁠把那银⁠钱丢在殿⁠里，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p3.b2": {
    "text": "出去吊死了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "出⁠去吊⁠死了。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p3.b3": {
    "text": "这是血价，不可放在库里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这是血价，不⁠可放⁠在库里。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p4.b1": {
    "text": "他们商议，就用那银钱买了窑户的一块田，为要埋葬外乡人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们商⁠议，就⁠用那银⁠钱买了窑户的一⁠块田，为要埋⁠葬外乡⁠人。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p4.b2": {
    "text": "所以那块田直到今日还叫做「血田」。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "所⁠以那块田直⁠到今⁠日还叫⁠做「血田」。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p4.b3": {
    "text": "这就应了先知耶利米的话，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这就⁠应了先⁠知耶利米的⁠话，说："
  },
  "matthew.27.p4.b4": {
    "text": "他们用那三十块钱，就是被估定之人的价钱……买了窑户的一块田；这是照着主所吩咐我的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:9-10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们用那三十⁠块⁠钱，就⁠是被估定⁠之人⁠的价⁠钱……买了窑户的一⁠块田；这是照着主所吩⁠咐我⁠的。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p5.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣站在巡抚面前；巡抚问他说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣站⁠在巡⁠抚面⁠前；巡⁠抚问他说："
  },
  "matthew.27.p5.b2": {
    "text": "你是犹太人的王吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠是犹⁠太⁠人的王吗？"
  },
  "matthew.27.p5.b3": {
    "text": "你说的是。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你说的⁠是。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p5.b4": {
    "text": "他们作见证告你这么多的事，你没有听见吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们作见⁠证告你这⁠么多的事，你没⁠有听⁠见吗？"
  },
  "matthew.27.p6.b1": {
    "text": "巡抚有一个常例，每逢这节期，随众人所要的释放一个囚犯给他们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "巡⁠抚有一⁠个常⁠例，每⁠逢这节期，随众⁠人所⁠要的释⁠放一⁠个囚⁠犯给他⁠们。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p6.b2": {
    "text": "当时有一个出名的囚犯叫巴拉巴。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "当⁠时有一⁠个出名的囚⁠犯叫巴⁠拉⁠巴。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p6.b3": {
    "text": "你们要我释放哪一个给你们？是巴拉巴呢？是称为基督的耶稣呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们要我释⁠放哪一⁠个给你⁠们？是巴⁠拉⁠巴呢？是称⁠为基⁠督的耶⁠稣呢？"
  },
  "matthew.27.p6.b4": {
    "text": "巡抚原知道他们是因为嫉妒才把他解了来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "巡⁠抚原知⁠道他⁠们是因⁠为嫉⁠妒才把他解了来。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p7.b1": {
    "text": "正坐堂的时候，他的夫人打发人来说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "正⁠坐堂的时⁠候，他⁠的夫⁠人打⁠发人来⁠说："
  },
  "matthew.27.p7.b2": {
    "text": "这义人的事，你一点不可管，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这义人⁠的事，你一⁠点不⁠可管，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p7.b3": {
    "text": "因为我今天在梦中为他受了许多的苦。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为我今⁠天在梦⁠中为他受了许⁠多的苦。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b1": {
    "text": "祭司长和长老挑唆众人，求释放巴拉巴，除灭耶稣。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "祭⁠司⁠长和长⁠老挑⁠唆众⁠人，求释⁠放巴⁠拉⁠巴，除灭耶⁠稣。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b2": {
    "text": "这两个人，你们要我释放哪一个给你们呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这两个⁠人，你⁠们要我释⁠放哪一⁠个给你⁠们呢？"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b3": {
    "text": "巴拉巴。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "巴⁠拉⁠巴。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b4": {
    "text": "这样，那称为基督的耶稣我怎么办他呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这⁠样，那称⁠为基⁠督的耶⁠稣我怎⁠么办他呢？"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b5": {
    "text": "为什么呢？他做了什么恶事呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "为⁠什⁠么呢？他做⁠了什⁠么恶事呢？"
  },
  "matthew.27.p8.b6": {
    "text": "把他钉十字架！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "把他钉十⁠字⁠架！"
  },
  "matthew.27.p9.b1": {
    "text": "彼拉多见说也无济于事，反要生乱，就拿水在众人面前洗手，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "彼⁠拉⁠多见说也无⁠济于⁠事，反要生乱，就⁠拿水在众⁠人面⁠前洗⁠手，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p9.b2": {
    "text": "流这义人的血，罪不在我，你们承当吧。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "流这义人⁠的血，罪不⁠在我，你⁠们承当吧。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p9.b3": {
    "text": "他的血归到我们和我们的子孙身上。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠的血归⁠到我⁠们和我⁠们的子⁠孙身⁠上。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p10.b1": {
    "text": "于是彼拉多释放巴拉巴给他们，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是彼⁠拉⁠多释⁠放巴⁠拉⁠巴给他⁠们，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p10.b2": {
    "text": "把耶稣鞭打了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "把耶⁠稣鞭⁠打了，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p10.b3": {
    "text": "交给人钉十字架。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "交⁠给人钉十⁠字⁠架。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p11.b1": {
    "text": "巡抚的兵就把耶稣带进衙门，叫全营的兵都聚集在他那里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "巡⁠抚的兵就⁠把耶⁠稣带进衙⁠门，叫全营的兵都聚⁠集在他那⁠里。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p11.b2": {
    "text": "他们给他脱了衣服，穿上一件朱红色袍子，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们给他脱⁠了衣⁠服，穿⁠上一⁠件朱红⁠色袍⁠子，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p11.b3": {
    "text": "恭喜，犹太人的王啊！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "恭⁠喜，犹⁠太⁠人的王啊！"
  },
  "matthew.27.p11.b4": {
    "text": "又吐唾沫在他脸上，拿苇子打他的头。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又吐⁠唾⁠沫在他脸上，拿苇子打他⁠的头。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p12.b1": {
    "text": "戏弄完了，……仍穿上他自己的衣服，带他出去，要钉十字架。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "戏⁠弄完⁠了，……仍穿⁠上他自⁠己的衣⁠服，带他出⁠去，要钉十⁠字⁠架。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p12.b2": {
    "text": "他们出来的时候，遇见一个古利奈人，……就勉强他同去，好背着耶稣的十字架。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们出⁠来的时⁠候，遇⁠见一⁠个古⁠利⁠奈人，……就勉⁠强他同⁠去，好背着耶⁠稣的十⁠字⁠架。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p12.b3": {
    "text": "到了一个地方名叫各各他，意思就是「髑髅地」。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "到⁠了一⁠个地⁠方名⁠叫各⁠各⁠他，意⁠思就⁠是「髑⁠髅⁠地」。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p12.b4": {
    "text": "兵丁拿苦胆调和的酒给耶稣喝；他尝了，就不肯喝。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "兵⁠丁拿苦胆调⁠和的酒给耶⁠稣喝；他尝⁠了，就不⁠肯喝。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p13.b1": {
    "text": "他们既将他钉在十字架上，就拈阄分他的衣服，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们既将他钉⁠在十⁠字⁠架上，就拈阄分他⁠的衣⁠服，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p13.b2": {
    "text": "又坐在那里看守他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又坐⁠在那⁠里看⁠守他。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p13.b3": {
    "text": "在他头以上安一个牌子，写着他的罪状，说：「这是犹太人的王耶稣。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "在他头以⁠上安一⁠个牌⁠子，写着他⁠的罪⁠状，说：「这是犹⁠太⁠人的王耶⁠稣。」"
  },
  "matthew.27.p13.b4": {
    "text": "当时，有两个强盗和他同钉十字架，一个在右边，一个在左边。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "当⁠时，有两个强⁠盗和他同钉十⁠字⁠架，一⁠个在右⁠边，一⁠个在左⁠边。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p14.b1": {
    "text": "从那里经过的人讥诮他，摇着头，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "从那⁠里经⁠过的人讥⁠诮他，摇着头，说："
  },
  "matthew.27.p14.b2": {
    "text": "你这拆毁圣殿、三日又建造起来的，可以救自己吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你这拆毁圣⁠殿、三⁠日又建⁠造起⁠来的，可⁠以救自⁠己吧！"
  },
  "matthew.27.p14.b3": {
    "text": "你如果是　神的儿子，就从十字架上下来吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你如⁠果是　神的儿⁠子，就从十⁠字⁠架上下⁠来吧！"
  },
  "matthew.27.p15.b1": {
    "text": "他救了别人，不能救自己。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他救了别⁠人，不⁠能救自⁠己。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p15.b2": {
    "text": "他是以色列的王，现在可以从十字架上下来，我们就信他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠是以⁠色⁠列的王，现⁠在可⁠以从十⁠字⁠架上下⁠来，我⁠们就信他。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p15.b3": {
    "text": "他倚靠　神，　神若喜悦他，现在可以救他；因为他曾说：『我是　神的儿子。』",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他倚⁠靠　神，　神若喜⁠悦他，现⁠在可⁠以救他；因⁠为他曾说：『我⁠是　神的儿⁠子。』"
  },
  "matthew.27.p15.b4": {
    "text": "那和他同钉的强盗也是这样地讥诮他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那和他同钉的强⁠盗也⁠是这⁠样地讥⁠诮他。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p16.b1": {
    "text": "从午正到申初，遍地都黑暗了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "从午正到申初，遍⁠地都黑⁠暗了。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p16.b2": {
    "text": "以利！以利！拉马撒巴各大尼？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "以利！以利！拉马撒巴各⁠大尼？"
  },
  "matthew.27.p16.b3": {
    "text": "就是说：「我的　神！我的　神！为什么离弃我？」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就⁠是说：「我⁠的　神！我⁠的　神！为⁠什⁠么离⁠弃我？」"
  },
  "matthew.27.p16.b4": {
    "text": "这个人呼叫以利亚呢！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:47"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这⁠个人呼⁠叫以⁠利⁠亚呢！"
  },
  "matthew.27.p17.b1": {
    "text": "内中有一个人赶紧跑去，拿海绒蘸满了醋，绑在苇子上，送给他喝。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:48"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "内中⁠有一⁠个人赶⁠紧跑⁠去，拿海绒蘸满⁠了醋，绑在苇子上，送⁠给他喝。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p17.b2": {
    "text": "且等着，看以利亚来救他不来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:49"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "且等⁠着，看以⁠利⁠亚来救他⁠不来。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p17.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣又大声喊叫，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣又大⁠声喊⁠叫，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p17.b4": {
    "text": "气就断了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.27.p18.b1": {
    "text": "忽然，殿里的幔子从上到下裂为两半，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:51"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "忽⁠然，殿⁠里的幔子从上到下裂为两半，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p18.b2": {
    "text": "地也震动，磐石也崩裂，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:51"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "地也震⁠动，磐⁠石也崩⁠裂，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p18.b3": {
    "text": "坟墓也开了，已睡圣徒的身体多有起来的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:52"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "坟⁠墓也开了，已睡圣⁠徒的身⁠体多有起⁠来的。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p18.b4": {
    "text": "到耶稣复活以后，他们从坟墓里出来，进了圣城，向许多人显现。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:53"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "到耶⁠稣复⁠活以⁠后，他⁠们从坟⁠墓里出⁠来，进了圣⁠城，向许⁠多人显⁠现。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p19.b1": {
    "text": "百夫长和一同看守耶稣的人看见地震并所经历的事，就极其害怕，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:54"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "百⁠夫⁠长和一⁠同看⁠守耶⁠稣的人看⁠见地⁠震并所经⁠历的事，就极⁠其害⁠怕，说："
  },
  "matthew.27.p19.b2": {
    "text": "这真是神的儿子了！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:54"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这真⁠是神的儿⁠子了！"
  },
  "matthew.27.p19.b3": {
    "text": "有好些妇女在那里，远远地观看；她们是从加利利跟随耶稣来服事他的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:55"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有好⁠些妇⁠女在那⁠里，远⁠远地观⁠看；她⁠们是从加⁠利⁠利跟⁠随耶⁠稣来服事他⁠的。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p19.b4": {
    "text": "内中有抹大拉的马利亚，又有雅各和约西的母亲马利亚，并有西庇太两个儿子的母亲。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:56"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "内中⁠有抹⁠大⁠拉的马⁠利⁠亚，又⁠有雅⁠各和约⁠西的母⁠亲马⁠利⁠亚，并有西⁠庇⁠太两个儿⁠子的母⁠亲。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p20.b1": {
    "text": "到了晚上，有一个财主，名叫约瑟，是亚利马太来的，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:57"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "到⁠了晚⁠上，有一⁠个财⁠主，名⁠叫约⁠瑟，是亚⁠利马⁠太来的，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p20.b2": {
    "text": "他也是耶稣的门徒。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:57"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他也⁠是耶⁠稣的门⁠徒。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p20.b3": {
    "text": "这人去见彼拉多，求耶稣的身体；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:58"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这人⁠去见彼⁠拉⁠多，求耶⁠稣的身⁠体；"
  },
  "matthew.27.p20.b4": {
    "text": "彼拉多就吩咐给他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:58"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "彼⁠拉⁠多就吩⁠咐给他。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p21.b1": {
    "text": "约瑟取了身体，用干净细麻布裹好，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:59"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "约⁠瑟取了身⁠体，用干⁠净细⁠麻⁠布裹⁠好，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p21.b2": {
    "text": "安放在自己的新坟墓里，就是他凿在磐石里的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:60"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "安放⁠在自⁠己的新坟⁠墓里，就⁠是他凿在磐⁠石里的。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p21.b3": {
    "text": "他又把大石头滚到墓门口，就去了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:60"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他又把大石⁠头滚⁠到墓门⁠口，就去⁠了。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p22.b1": {
    "text": "有抹大拉的马利亚和那个马利亚在那里，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:61"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有抹⁠大⁠拉的马⁠利⁠亚和那⁠个马⁠利⁠亚在那⁠里，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p22.b2": {
    "text": "对着坟墓坐着。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:61"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "对着坟⁠墓坐着。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p23.b1": {
    "text": "次日，就是预备日的第二天，祭司长和法利赛人聚集来见彼拉多，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:62"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "次日，就⁠是预⁠备⁠日的第⁠二天，祭⁠司⁠长和法⁠利⁠赛人聚⁠集来⁠见彼⁠拉⁠多，说："
  },
  "matthew.27.p23.b2": {
    "text": "大人，我们记得那诱惑人的还活着的时候曾说：『三日后我要复活。』",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:63"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "大⁠人，我⁠们记⁠得那诱⁠惑人⁠的还活⁠着的时⁠候曾说：『三⁠日后我⁠要复⁠活。』"
  },
  "matthew.27.p23.b3": {
    "text": "因此，请吩咐人将坟墓把守妥当，直到第三日，恐怕他的门徒来，把他偷了去……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:64"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠此，请吩⁠咐人将坟⁠墓把⁠守妥⁠当，直⁠到第⁠三日，恐⁠怕他⁠的门⁠徒来，把他偷⁠了去……"
  },
  "matthew.27.p23.b4": {
    "text": "这样，那后来的迷惑比先前的更利害了！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:64"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这⁠样，那后⁠来的迷⁠惑比先⁠前的更利⁠害了！"
  },
  "matthew.27.p24.b1": {
    "text": "你们有看守的兵，去吧！尽你们所能的把守妥当。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:65"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们有看⁠守的兵，去吧！尽你⁠们所⁠能的把⁠守妥⁠当。"
  },
  "matthew.27.p24.b2": {
    "text": "他们就带着看守的兵同去，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:66"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们就带着看⁠守的兵同⁠去，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p24.b3": {
    "text": "封了石头，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:66"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "封⁠了石⁠头，"
  },
  "matthew.27.p24.b4": {
    "text": "将坟墓把守妥当。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Matthew 27:66"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "将坟⁠墓把⁠守妥⁠当。"
  }
}
